OL,3,AAnthropic becomes one of world's most  
OL,4,Avaluable public companies in stock     
OL,5,Amarket debut                           
OL,7,FAnthropic's shares flew past its       
OL,8,Fallocation price of $83 each, showing  
OL,9,Fthere was plenty of excitement around  
OL,10,FAI.                                    
OL,12,FYet the company, which is behind AI    
OL,13,Fchatbot Claude, will remain under      
OL,14,Fintense scrutiny in the months ahead to
OL,15,Fanswer the key question surrounding AI:
OL,16,Fis it all worth it?                    
